# Design directory: LOCAL-ONLY by policy.
# Everything under design/ — design docs, ADRs, evaluations, plans, pentest
# reports, chaos reports, AND architecture diagrams (design/diagrams/) — stays
# on the maintainer's workstation and is NEVER pushed to GitHub. Treat it as
# scratchpad + private review material; do not link to specific files from
# public docs.
design/
# Defense-in-depth: also block any top-level diagrams/ from being created
# accidentally outside design/.
diagrams/
